{"id":"e8040516-d1f9-4198-9dce-4198da4ce115","expr":"!result || (cs.length() >= csStart + length && string.length() >= start + length)","rationale":"If result is true, the specified regions must be valid; i.e., indices plus length don't exceed sequence lengths.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#regionMatchesAscii(CharSequence,boolean,int,CharSequence,int,int):boolean","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:00.518607549Z"}
