{"id":"8aa2bc24-cabd-40b9-8df6-6073f6dc125f","expr":"str != null && searchStr != null","rationale":"The method immediately returns if str or searchStr is null, so at entry both are typically non-null to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:00.704800210Z"}
{"id":"71b89c01-427f-4a7d-87d2-9e128ba52f24","expr":"startPos >= 0","rationale":"If startPos < 0 it is reset to 0 in the method, so it is safe to assume startPos >= 0 after normalization.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:00.704800210Z"}
{"id":"a5a89eb9-ad11-4983-bdc7-96b9cf31d691","expr":"startPos <= str.length()","rationale":"If startPos exceeds the valid search region endLimit, method returns early, so startPos should not exceed str.length()","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:00.704800210Z"}
{"id":"3c36deec-b84a-40f8-b763-be5bbdcee337","expr":"searchStr.length() >= 0","rationale":"Length of any CharSequence can't be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:00.704800210Z"}
{"id":"7ea1a2cb-8866-449d-957c-5380f57f077d","expr":"str.length() >= searchStr.length()","rationale":"If searchStr is longer than str, search can never match, so at entry the method expects this.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:00.704800210Z"}
{"id":"aafbdc26-acd2-4120-90b5-497521009d05","expr":"(str == null || searchStr == null) == (result == -1)","rationale":"If either str or searchStr is null, the method returns INDEX_NOT_FOUND which is -1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:01.306987899Z"}
{"id":"d762357c-90d0-42f4-95ac-a8167f25e322","expr":"result == -1 || (startPos >= 0 && startPos <= str.length() - searchStr.length())","rationale":"The method returns -1 if startPos is out of valid bounds, otherwise startPos is valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:01.306987899Z"}
{"id":"74c568f2-30d3-4ef5-9ddd-9871e7223b4f","expr":"result == -1 || (result >= startPos && result <= str.length() - searchStr.length())","rationale":"If a match is found, the returned index is between startPos and the last valid index for searchStr in str.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:01.306987899Z"}
{"id":"feeace81-eb78-47f5-a6c3-d7114513dba3","expr":"searchStr.length() == 0 == (result == startPos)","rationale":"If searchStr is empty, the method returns startPos; otherwise it does not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:01.306987899Z"}
{"id":"61c39438-ccb1-42d6-acab-ab2a40de3753","expr":"result == -1 || (str.subSequence(result, result + searchStr.length()).toString().equalsIgnoreCase(searchStr.toString()))","rationale":"The found index position corresponds to a substring matching searchStr ignoring case.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCase(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:01.306987899Z"}
{"id":"35cb12c4-01ed-429b-9bf0-bab6b23766d0","expr":"result == -1 || (result >= startPos && result <= str.length() - searchStr.length())","rationale":"The method returns -1 if searchStr not found; otherwise returns index >= startPos and where the substring can fit in str.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCaseAscii(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.583582983Z"}
{"id":"9a9ef270-ea90-480d-905d-cf4746d90e1b","expr":"str != null && searchStr != null || result == -1","rationale":"The method returns INDEX_NOT_FOUND (-1) if str or searchStr is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCaseAscii(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.583582983Z"}
{"id":"d7a16a85-0549-47ea-baa1-c3ac3dc3eea3","expr":"(searchStr.length() == 0) == (result == startPos)","rationale":"If searchStr is empty, method returns startPos (index 0 or adjusted).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOfIgnoreCaseAscii(CharSequence,CharSequence,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.583582983Z"}
{"id":"96d601c1-9466-4600-b06d-73aea6f7fb35","expr":"(a == b) || (Character.toLowerCase(a) == Character.toLowerCase(b))","rationale":"Either chars are equal, or their lowercases are equal as checked in the method","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#equalsIgnoreCase(char,char):boolean","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.654135931Z"}
