{"id":"352099ea-8921-4696-bf7d-6f64b85c2ba2","expr":"!result || (a == b || Character.toLowerCase(a) == Character.toLowerCase(b))","rationale":"If result is true, then a and b are equal ignoring case.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#equalsIgnoreCase(char,char):boolean","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.715885552Z"}
