{"id":"464c93dc-d8f6-449b-be4e-845da173ca3d","expr":"start >= 0 || start < 0","rationale":"start is an int parameter; method handles negative start by normalizing to 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOf(CharSequence,char,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.738932629Z"}
{"id":"3dcd265e-8761-44e8-9a60-65db9c7561ef","expr":"cs == null || cs.length() >= 0","rationale":"If cs is not null, length() returns non-negative, else cs can be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOf(CharSequence,char,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.738932629Z"}
{"id":"90c882b3-6af4-42aa-a919-412753f7eba6","expr":"cs == null || (start <= cs.length())","rationale":"start should be at most cs.length() for a meaningful search start index.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOf(CharSequence,char,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.738932629Z"}
{"id":"9f4e4e92-ea5a-4cdd-b563-83a7dbe21044","expr":"! (cs != null && cs.length() == 0 && start > 0)","rationale":"If cs is an empty sequence, start should not be positive for search to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOf(CharSequence,char,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.738932629Z"}
{"id":"0f914a66-9d61-40a1-b845-6e31b368e44a","expr":"cs == null || (start <= cs.length() && start >= 0)","rationale":"Typically start index should be within 0 and cs.length() inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#indexOf(CharSequence,char,int):int","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:02.738932629Z"}
{"id":"68eabcb5-0455-4d77-8c84-df7b44d2fee0","expr":"a >= 0 && a <= 127","rationale":"a and b represent ASCII character bytes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"io.netty.util.AsciiString#equalsIgnoreCase(byte,byte):boolean","file":"io/netty/util/AsciiString.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T11:46:03.366645200Z"}
